WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:05.110
If you want to see the epitome of management
by optics, a term that we've been discussing

00:00:05.110 --> 00:00:08.820
more and more lately, I have it for you today.

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:16.710
Look no further than CEOs told to remove their
masks before Mike Pence comes out to meet

00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:17.710
with them.

00:00:17.710 --> 00:00:20.390
Imagine that people around Mike Pence have
tested positive.

00:00:20.390 --> 00:00:24.589
Three people that we know of connected to
the White House have the virus.

00:00:24.589 --> 00:00:26.470
More are in quarantine.

00:00:26.470 --> 00:00:28.670
Pence's press secretary has the virus.

00:00:28.670 --> 00:00:33.030
Katie Miller, she happens to be the wife of
Trump adviser Steven Miller.

00:00:33.030 --> 00:00:36.730
Pence should be in quarantine, but is simply
not doing it.

00:00:36.730 --> 00:00:40.260
He has a meeting over the weekend with food
industry CEOs.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:42.630
They show up wearing masks, all five of them.

00:00:42.630 --> 00:00:44.430
They're doing the right thing.

00:00:44.430 --> 00:00:51.700
Someone from Pence's staff comes out or someone
guided by his staff comes out and tells them,

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:54.930
take off your masks before the vise president
comes out here.

00:00:54.930 --> 00:00:56.239
We actually have video of this.

00:00:56.239 --> 00:00:58.370
You don't even have to wonder how it went
down.

00:00:58.370 --> 00:00:59.730
We're playing the video for

00:00:59.730 --> 00:01:01.190
our TV audience.

00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:03.899
You actually see someone come out.

00:01:03.899 --> 00:01:05.860
All of the CEOs are wearing masks.

00:01:05.860 --> 00:01:07.370
She goes up to the CEOs.

00:01:07.370 --> 00:01:12.250
You see her say something and she actually
mimics the motion of mask removal.

00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:14.290
And they all do it, by the way.

00:01:14.290 --> 00:01:16.680
Notice how she's not wearing a mask.

00:01:16.680 --> 00:01:20.060
She gets right up in the faces of these five
CEOs.

00:01:20.060 --> 00:01:23.650
This is actually close enough to spread the
virus.

00:01:23.650 --> 00:01:28.220
There is no explanation for this other than
image and optics.

00:01:28.220 --> 00:01:35.119
This was hours after Pence's own press secretary
tested positive for a corona virus.

00:01:35.119 --> 00:01:41.720
And the Trump administration has turned the
mask into a political element rather than

00:01:41.720 --> 00:01:44.189
excuse my might on a phrase here.

00:01:44.189 --> 00:01:48.020
It's a political element rather than a well,
an element of medical for lack of a better

00:01:48.020 --> 00:01:49.020
term now.

00:01:49.020 --> 00:01:50.020
OK.

00:01:50.020 --> 00:01:51.020
That's sort of a joke.

00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:53.630
But this is merely a public health item

00:01:53.630 --> 00:01:57.100
and it is now being used politically.

00:01:57.100 --> 00:02:03.450
If people all around Pence are wearing masks
and Mike Pence is not, it could make much

00:02:03.450 --> 00:02:05.060
Mike Pence look bad.

00:02:05.060 --> 00:02:09.140
But it also makes it seem like it's unsafe
out there.

00:02:09.140 --> 00:02:13.860
And people have to be worried about getting
the virus, which they do.

00:02:13.860 --> 00:02:18.750
And that is why people are not allowed to
be masked up around Mike Pence during this

00:02:18.750 --> 00:02:19.750
roundtable.

00:02:19.750 --> 00:02:22.710
And it's all about pretending everything's
normal.

00:02:22.710 --> 00:02:26.920
It's about being economic warriors for the
stock market.

00:02:26.920 --> 00:02:29.640
Trump is increasingly using that term.

00:02:29.640 --> 00:02:34.000
Economic warriors before people were warriors
for staying home.

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:36.280
Now they're warriors for not staying home.

00:02:36.280 --> 00:02:37.550
It's completely Orwellian.

00:02:37.550 --> 00:02:41.830
Kaley McInerney was asked about it at a recent
press briefing and reporters were confused

00:02:41.830 --> 00:02:44.650
because at first it was I thought I thought
people were staying home.

00:02:44.650 --> 00:02:46.740
And that was that was the war we were fighting.

00:02:46.740 --> 00:02:47.740
But

00:02:47.740 --> 00:02:50.620
now it's people are warriors by no longer
staying home and just getting out there.

00:02:50.620 --> 00:02:52.890
And McCann and he said, that's right, they're
all warriors.

00:02:52.890 --> 00:02:55.530
When they were staying home, they were warriors
now being out there, warriors.

00:02:55.530 --> 00:03:00.680
And as usual, these things become vicious
circles and self-fulfilling prophecies because

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:07.530
the CDC recommended first responders wear
masks starting in very early April.

00:03:07.530 --> 00:03:09.570
Now, they didn't have them available.

00:03:09.570 --> 00:03:13.990
Police departments, fire departments, et cetera,
needed to find the masks.

00:03:13.990 --> 00:03:17.190
But that was the recommendation starting on
April 3rd.

00:03:17.190 --> 00:03:19.340
That was five weeks ago.

00:03:19.340 --> 00:03:23.270
Imagine how much better off we would be and
how much better off the economy would be.

00:03:23.270 --> 00:03:24.930
This is a point I keep making.

00:03:24.930 --> 00:03:27.730
If on April 3rd, everybody started wearing
masks.

00:03:27.730 --> 00:03:33.640
If on March 5th or 7th or 10th, Donald Trump
said, hey, 50 governors, let's do a stay at

00:03:33.640 --> 00:03:35.530
home 30 days, you probably end

00:03:35.530 --> 00:03:37.860
up having to extend it 15 or 30 more.

00:03:37.860 --> 00:03:39.100
That would be over by now.

00:03:39.100 --> 00:03:40.420
We would be done with that.

00:03:40.420 --> 00:03:43.610
Trump just pretending that everything is fine.

00:03:43.610 --> 00:03:46.160
It also won't work for the country.

00:03:46.160 --> 00:03:48.500
Tons of people are going to die.

00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:53.540
But this make believe, play pretend stuff
that the Trump administration is doing about

00:03:53.540 --> 00:03:55.230
business as usual.

00:03:55.230 --> 00:04:00.580
It can work for a few weeks, but if the numbers
don't improve, it's going to implode.

00:04:00.580 --> 00:04:05.800
We have five and a half months left before
we will get the opportunity to remove every

00:04:05.800 --> 00:04:07.630
last one of these people.

00:04:07.630 --> 00:04:12.250
And we have to not allow a lot of the stuff
we've talked about today on all needs to happen.

00:04:12.250 --> 00:04:14.110
We can't allow this stuff to become normal.

00:04:14.110 --> 00:04:15.720
We can't become numb to it.

00:04:15.720 --> 00:04:18.460
The hyper normalization happens naturally.

00:04:18.460 --> 00:04:19.460
To some degree.

00:04:19.460 --> 00:04:21.650
Humans just adapt to what's going on.

00:04:21.650 --> 00:04:22.650
If you're used

00:04:22.650 --> 00:04:25.970
to seeing fifteen hundred to twenty five hundred
people a day die of corona virus if it happens

00:04:25.970 --> 00:04:27.590
for long enough.

00:04:27.590 --> 00:04:31.830
And most people's lives remember, we're a
country of 331 million.

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:35.390
Most people's lives seem sort of stable.

00:04:35.390 --> 00:04:37.590
It's very easy for that to become normal.

00:04:37.590 --> 00:04:44.170
Much the same way the continued insistence
or sort of make believe is essentially what

00:04:44.170 --> 00:04:45.540
it is about.

00:04:45.540 --> 00:04:46.540
Everything's fine.

00:04:46.540 --> 00:04:47.540
The economy's opening.

00:04:47.540 --> 00:04:48.690
Here's a list of states opening.

00:04:48.690 --> 00:04:49.690
Testing is great.

00:04:49.690 --> 00:04:50.690
It's all great.

00:04:50.690 --> 00:04:51.690
That does.

00:04:51.690 --> 00:05:40.900
Work and we need to fight really hard to make
sure that we don't fall

00:05:40.900 --> 00:06:51.780
for it.

